  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Apps can be configured with any OpenID provider as a custom identity provider for the App Service Authentication feature. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To learn more, see <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/app-service/configure-authentication-provider-openid-connect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Configure an OpenID Connect provider</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Apps can be configured with any OpenID provider as a custom identity provider for the App Service Authentication feature.\n\nTo learn more, see Configure an OpenID Connect provider ."
  },
